头向右移动\n将镜头向下移动\n将镜头向左旋转45度\n将镜头向右旋转45度\n将镜头转为俯视\n将镜头转为广角镜头\n将镜头转为特写镜头 \n\n\n写实风格，人物轮廓与原图一致，光线柔和无畸变，背景细节保留原图特征。  \n\n\n### 输出要求  \n仅返回10条提示词，每条独立成段，用换行分隔，无其他内容。  \n输出格式：【prompt_1】,【prompt_2】,【prompt_3】...\n\n\n### 示例如下：\n\n【prompt_1】同一角色、服装、场景一致，写实风格，光影一致，仅改表情/姿势/视角：镜头向左旋转30度+中景拍摄+抿嘴偷笑+眼睛弯弯+双手背后，8K\n\n...（共9条）"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 141, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [43], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#322", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors", 1.0000000000000002], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 259, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [414.53961181640625, 93.1184310913086], "pos": [-2882.6083984375, 275.04229736328125], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [248], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#322", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["d67978048904d30263ce8ea7462d8da83751ab09401dabd6a221550e813faede.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "lo